/S /H2
/P 85 0 R
/T (Preparing meals often involves many ingredients, but identifying them manually from a photo can be time-consuming and inconsistent. A computer vision system that automatically detects common ingredients can serve as the foundation for applications such as recipe recommendations, meal organization, and nutrition tools.)
